                                          2508  # Instruction PEEKA (e1 xx), 24 cycles
                                          2509  # * Load byte at location [vAC] and store into byte [xx]
                                          2510  # * Origin: https://forum.gigatron.io/viewtopic.php?p=2053#p2053
                                          2511  #   Section 2. "POKE and DOKE work backwards"
